[00:06.77] <Time don't stop>
[00:11.50] <It don't wait>
[00:16.72] <And it sure don't ask permission>
[00:30.30] <Mmm. I used to think I had forever>
[00:41.64] <another sunrise, one more year>
[00:45.54] <Then somehow all those some days turned into wish I'd done it here>
[00:52.64] <The clock kept ticking while I worked>
[00:55.74] <while I worried, and while I planned>
[00:59.28] <It never cared what I was doing>
[01:02.74] <It never slowed at my command>
[01:07.44] <Time don't give a damn about your plans or pride>
[01:15.24] <It keeps on rolling down the road no matter how hard you try>
[01:22.32] <You can't bargain with tomorrow or buy yesterday again>
[01:28.74] <Time don't give a damn>
[01:32.10] <It just keeps moving on>
[02:03.36] <I watched children turn to parents and parents turn gray with age>
[02:10.42] <I've seen young dreams become old memories without a warning on the page>
[02:17.94] <Now I waste a whole lot less on things that don't belong>
[02:24.54] <'Cause every minute's worth more now than when I thought life was long>
[02:32.32] <Time don't give a damn if you're ready or you're not>
[02:40.52] <It don't stop for broken hearts or dreams that time forgot>
[02:47.64] <So love while you can love and say the words you never said>
[02:54.08] <Time don't give a damn, 'til one day your time is spent>
[03:08.36] <Funny how the years teach lessons no teacher ever could>
[03:14.30] <You learn the value of each moment when you finally understood>
[03:22.08] <Time don't give a damn>
[03:26.40] <but that don't make it cruel>
[03:30.38] <It gives the same twenty-four hours to every woman, every man>
[03:37.48] <So laugh a little louder, hold the ones you love again>
[03:43.92] <Time don't give a damn>
[03:47.90] <That's why today matters>
[03:58.64] <Time never promised forever>
[04:04.22] <It only promised now>